          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/houthis-seize-yemens-strategic-red-sea-port-city-of-mokha-from-saudi-backed-forces/articleshow/134025249.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
